  "name": "Question 8",
  "problem": "Which statement is equivalent to $(A∧B)∨¬C?$",
  "worked_solution": "We distribute the disjunction over the conjunction, as follows:\n\n$$\n(A∧B)∨¬C≡(A∨¬C)∧(B∨¬C)\n$$",
